"content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le08ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le08ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le08ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Have you ever heard of the \u201cgold rush\u201d or the \u201cklondike\u201d? In 1848, gold was found in California. Here is a letter from one of the miners to his family back home.<br/><br/>My Dearest Janey,\n</br>\nAlthough I have just been here awhile, I am still learning how to survive in this strange atmosphere. So many people have arrived recently that I am lucky to have found a sound place to live, a claim that is my own. Here, I have only just finished my small cabin with a stove, a cot, so I am more comfortable at night than I was in the tent.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le08ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "When I go to town for supplies I see such sights! Clothing of all descriptions has been strewn all over the ground as if it cost nothing at all, left by those that have moved on as expected to mines further north. Why have shirts that haven't been worn more than once up to now been thrown away?<br/>People haven't wanted to pay for washing so far, so everything is discarded indiscriminately. I haven't seen anyone pick a piece up and take it up yet either. These are as odd times as I ever thought I might experience!", "id": 2, "time": "42400", "image": "engenn10le08ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Out on the claim is as lonely a place as any man can stand. There are times when I work that I have lifted my head to realize I  haven't spoken a word so far that day! But fear not Janey, I haven't lost  my heart up to now. I know you are thinking of me with love as I think of you.</br></br>I hide my gold as a squirrel does his winter food. Have you wondered what I've amassed until now. I shall shower you with it when I arrive before the next snowfall.</br></br>Your loving husband,</br>\nHiram", "id": 3, "time": "80000", "image": "engenn10le08ob06re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}